# Code coverage reports
**/console/
**/vcl/
# GITIGNORE-SHAPES-1: the two rules above also matched the Console and VCL
# SAMPLE folders (git on Windows ignores case), so samples/tests/Delphi/Console,
# samples/tests/Delphi/VCL and samples/tests/Lazarus/Console were never
# committed although samples/tests/README.md documents them. Re-include them;
# IDE files inside (*.res, *.dsk, *.local, ...) stay ignored by the rules below.
!samples/tests/Delphi/Console/
!samples/tests/Delphi/VCL/
!samples/tests/Lazarus/Console/
dunitx-results.xml
*.bak

